### ============================================================
###  AUTH — /auth
### ============================================================

### [1] Register a new user
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

###

### [2] Register — validation error (weak password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Bad User",
  "email": "bad@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

###

### [3] Register — validation error (invalid email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Bad User",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

###

### [4] Register — conflict (duplicate email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "John Doe Again",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

###

### [5] Login — valid credentials
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

###

### [6] Login — wrong password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

###

### [7] Login — user not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "ghost@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

###

### [8] Login — missing fields (validation error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john@example.com"
}


### ============================================================
###  USERS — /users  (Protected Routes)
### ============================================================

### [9] Get current user profile — valid token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJjbXBxZGRwNGkwMDAwOGt1bHF2ZmxvcTZsIiwiZW1haWwiOiJqb2huQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgwMDI2MTQ1LCJleHAiOjE3ODA2MzA5NDV9.KJSnksQFzMQT21Z-iB-oDFb-ZhdsGUjP_R2f4_DrUDo

###

### [10] Get current user email only — valid token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/email
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### [11] Get current user — no token (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me

###

### [12] Get current user — invalid/malformed token (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer this.is.not.a.valid.token

###

### [13] Get current user — expired token (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMjM0NTY3ODkwIiwiZW1haWwiOiJleHBpcmVkQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNTE2MjM5MDIyLCJleHAiOjE1MTYyMzkwMjJ9.4Adcj3UFYzPUVaVF43FmMze1B1e2JsLKwF5RTN1POHY


### ============================================================
###  EXTRA — Whitelist & Forbidden Fields Test
### ============================================================

### [14] Register with extra unknown fields (should be rejected or stripped)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Hacker",
  "email": "hacker@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!",
  "isAdmin": true,
  "role": "superadmin"
}

###

### [15] Health check (if you have one)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

